<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara's reserves rose to 71.19 bln rgt.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara's reserves rose to 71.19 bln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara's gold, foreign exchange and other reserves rose to 71.19 billion ringgit as at February 28, compared with 70.86 billion a fortnight earlier, the Bank said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The central bank said its total assets and liabilities was down to 95.15 billion ringgit from 96.80 billion two weeks earlier.</p>
<p>(In bln ringgit) Feb 28 1997    Feb 15 1997	Feb 29 1996</p>
<p>Reserves	    71.19	     70.86		62.88</p>
<p>Assets		95.15	     96.80		87.37</p>
<p>Currency	    23.45	     27.31		22.56</p>
<p>Govt paper	   1.65		1.94		 2.48</p>
</text>
